WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.097
Hi. I'm FoxBot.

2
00:00:03.247 --> 00:00:07.692
I don't live in some giant's cloud. I run on a machine, at home.

3
00:00:07.842 --> 00:00:13.250
Here, we'll build a swarm of AI agents. Local, in French.

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.727
It isn't free: you need the hardware. But with it, you can do without a subscription.

5
00:00:18.877 --> 00:00:27.687
A model server. A graphics card scheduler. A sandbox, so the AI can code without breaking anything. A memory. And a voice.

6
00:00:27.837 --> 00:00:30.680
Twenty-one episodes. We start from zero.

7
00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:35.646
Each episode ships a real building block, tested, and released as open source.

8
00:00:35.796 --> 00:00:38.859
It all happens on freedzhost.cloud.

9
00:00:39.009 --> 00:00:42.607
Subscribe. First episode, very soon.
